What kind of stat would you like to add to this dashboard?

<form>
	<div class="block-sections">
		<ul>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TicketsOpen" checked="checked" /> Count of open (not resolved) tickets</label></h3></header>
				<p>Count of tickets that are open</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TicketsAwaitingAgent" checked="checked" /> Count of tickets awaiting agent</label></h3></header>
				<p>Count of tickets that are awaiting agent</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="RateOfTicketsProcessed" /> Rate of tickets processed</label></h3></header>
				<p>This plots the ratio of tickets opened versus resolved.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TotalTicketMessages" /> Count of all ticket messages</label></h3></header>
				<p>This counts the total number of ticket messages (new tickets and new replies) submitted.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TicketsAgentParticipate" /> Count of tickets agents participated in</label></h3></header>
				<p>This counts the total number of tickets an agent participated in.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TotalTicketResolveTime" /> Time from ticket creation to ticket resolution</label></h3></header>
				<p>This plots the time it takes for a ticket to be resolved.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TotalUserWaitingTicketResolvedTime" /> Total user waiting time</label></h3></header>
				<p>This plots the total time a user waits before a ticket is resolved.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TotalAgentWaitingTicketResolvedTime" /> Total agent waiting time</label></h3></header>
				<p>This plots the total time agents wait before a ticket is resolved.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TicketFirstResponseTime" /> Time until first response</label></h3></header>
				<p>This plots the time it takes for an agent to make an initial response.</p>
			</li>

			<li>
				<header><h3><label><input type="radio" name="concept_class" value="TicketsNew" /> Count of new tickets created</label></h3></header>
				<p>This plots the number of new tickets created.</p>
			</li>

			<li class="footer">
				<button class="clean-white">{{ phrase('agent.general.continue') }}</button>
			</li>

		</ul>
	</div>
</form>